 "description": "utilpeek: parse a User-Agent string. For known x402 monitors and indexers with call rates use identify_x402_client. A User-Agent is self-reported and easy to fake; `is_bot` is a heuristic (declared crawlers, HTTP libraries, headless browsers). Parsed with ua-parser and the uap-core regexes (Apache-2.0). Typically under 0.1 s (first call up to 0.5 s). Price: USD 0.001. Free: 10 utilpeek calls per IP per UTC day. Docs: https://tanod.dev/learn/user-agent-parser-api.html",
